This architectural layout provides a complete, compilation-ready, multi-threaded Transport Management System implemented in modern C#. 

The codebase is engineered with strict clean-architecture separation, prioritizing thread safety, asynchronous lock-free or low-overhead processing structures, and memory-efficient data structures.

---

### Architectural Design & Flow Analysis

```
                                      +---------------------------------------------+
                                      |         Module 1: Telemetry Tracker         |
                                      | - Ingests Raw Speed & GPS Streams           |
                                      | - Detects Multi-Tick Speeding Violations    |
                                      +----------------------+----------------------+
                                                             |
                                                             | (TelemetryProcessed Event)
                                                             v
+------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                           Integration / Synchronization Bridge                                          |
|  Calculates real-time congestion indices from current vs. nominal speeds and converts updates into live weight overrides |
+------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------+
                                                             |
                                                             | (Live Multiplier Updates)
                                                             v
+------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                     Module 2: Route Optimization Engine                                                 |
| - Manages physical segment graph infrastructure via ReaderWriterLockSlim                                                |
| - Safely handles incoming weight adjustments concurrently with multiple Dijkstra solver workers                           |
+------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------+
                                                             |
                                                             | (Completes Route Deliveries)
                                                             v
                                      +----------------------+----------------------+
                                      |         Module 3: Billing Subsystem         |
                                      | - Buffers trip details in Bounded Channel   |
                                      | - Calculates dynamic tolls & invoices       |
                                      +---------------------------------------------+
```

